<title>SRI LANKA: Hatton National 3-month net up 5.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Hatton National 3-month net up 5.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Hatton National Bank Ltd, for the three months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	   1,418.09   vs     1,060.26</p>
<p>    Net profit	   107.97   vs	 102.04</p>
<p>    Tax provision	 35.00   vs	  22.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Hatton National Bank Ltd is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
